WEBVTT

00:01:29.085 --> 00:01:31.045
Our punch line is clear:

00:01:31.045 --> 00:01:34.090
there is good in us,
and it does good for us.

00:01:35.299 --> 00:01:36.843
Now, people love hearing this,

00:01:36.843 --> 00:01:39.387
but in 2020, I started to hate saying it.

00:01:39.387 --> 00:01:42.223
I was building hope in others
while losing my own.

00:01:42.265 --> 00:01:45.393
I was evangelizing
for human kindness all day

00:01:45.434 --> 00:01:47.478
and then doomscrolling at night.

00:01:47.520 --> 00:01:50.606
I was peddling something
that I would never want to buy anymore.

00:01:51.399 --> 00:01:52.942
I felt like a fraud,

00:01:52.942 --> 00:01:55.862
or, at best, maybe a fax-machine salesman.

00:01:55.903 --> 00:01:57.947
(Laughter)

00:01:57.989 --> 00:01:59.115
But here's the thing.

00:01:59.657 --> 00:02:02.952
You might think that cynicism
is a system upgrade